[{"client_msg_id":"b1399b6b-47a8-44ca-a01f-0b6760cece1d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim9script のエラー、だいたい 1000 番台(E1073 とか)が付いているけど、ヘルプは一切ない。さすが experimental…","ts":"1629297556.095800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"es+b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"118dfa48-bd7b-4150-a360-d2e3e456b815","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あ、でも Nos. は実際言われますね（論文の実験条件とかで No. 1 みたいに書いてるとき、複数の条件を参照するときは Nos. を使う）","ts":"1629268981.094700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KOX3A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e404cb77-4fa0-4653-b9ed-a17f69125e7c","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"（No. へのリンクを貼ろうとしたら勝手に No に書き換えられた。Ctrl+Shift+U でリンク先を直接入力しても末尾の . が削除されたので、結局 No%2E と入力して対処）","ts":"1629268907.092700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a46bZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8039cee9-bb0e-4933-bf18-ad237b2919e1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u0026gt; 英語の numbers（複数形）の省略形は nos. である\n:nanimo-wakaranai:","ts":"1629268365.090100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CFb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"122f1cd8-5cdb-4b77-816c-8e71c67cd702","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"ドイツ語は Nr. らしいけど、オランダ語もそうなんだろうか？","ts":"1629268268.089700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gx/=V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8bf765e-6d6f-4757-8c90-40055c297f65","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/No%2E|https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/No.\u003e\nnaruhodo?","ts":"1629268060.088600","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: No.","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"No.","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/No%2E","text":"No. は、番号を示す数字の前に置かれる記号であり、英語では numero sign と呼ぶ。日本語では「ナンバー（英語: number）」と読まれる。番号記号の # と意味はほぼ同じで、たとえば「No. 5」なら5番の意である。番号を意味する語の省略形 no. の最初の文字を大文字とし記号化された。\n元々ラテン語で「数えると」という意味の numero（numerus の単数奪格）の最初と最後の文字を取って no. となった。ロマンス語圏では、各国語で相当する語（スペイン語: número、ポルトガル語: número、フランス語: numéro、イタリア語: numero など）の略とも解釈される。英語でも number の省略形は no. である。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/No%2E","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/No%2E"}],"edited":{"user":"U6XP9LZ6V","ts":"1629268176.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"98F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e11c75fe-0461-4b9c-ae64-8cde53c5251b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"nmr","ts":"1629267780.088300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Srjs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"140869c6-2f7b-4dbd-b836-5cac4cefc769","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"かぶった","ts":"1629267766.088000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QlBU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c936a96-9b6b-4be7-b2f7-c48848b64ca3","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ラテン語のNumero由来かな","ts":"1629267757.087800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"//iB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fba48eb3-3e97-4bf6-aede-71e9a308629a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"シャープ警察とナンバーサイン警察と井桁警察がやってきたりしてw","ts":"1629267163.086400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YBoCt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0353225-5315-4734-a7d0-49abbd89c09b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"売上 #1","ts":"1629267093.086000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_t